  "description": "Archery was everything to the young prodigy Oh Bin-woo. But when he loses his parents in a tragic car accident, he gives up being an archer for good, believing that he’s the reason behind their deaths. Three years later, the sport he loved and dreaded the most calls for him once more when he’s accused of stealing a bow and challenged to an archery match. The question is… will he be able to overcome his trauma and hit perfect gold once more? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
